    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e565338e80179c90e00966e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小栗帽来到机场迎接。\n玉藻十字向自己考虑引退时所想起的她宣布──\n自己会在“宝冢纪念”好好表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c875e3022ddad4e70b4565b7e31dc4e0251f0be2f8e945b9ab8a8fda6f8613cc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
