    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70905240795b63c42eca9d78",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "玉藻十字和地方出身的小栗帽交谈。\n地方出身和家境贫困……虽同是不好的环境，\n但她们的生存之道却正好“相反”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "07b19b0ba3dc7155aec695e6baa7188a78531c42bc78f51ad3c7b426cf8e601f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1021/storytimeline_501021404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
