    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b544cb152c757f7a01c91ee8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小栗帽因为周遭的关爱，透过“满足”变得强大。\n相反地，\n玉藻十字则是因为“缺乏”而强大。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f22b2483238fca4d31458c098388b1b0a27d3268fd998024d05d21766d5a38fd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1021/storytimeline_501021404.json",
      "json_path": [
