      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:717979033d6d02b9e3917ff1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "没错，小栗帽就像是自己的分身。\n就像是另一个不同经历的自己。\n所以才会有着强烈的竞争意识。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2460b54dc84396ec8bbd0f048fb1068d4570e0e51ea72cc6c192e8447394517b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1021/storytimeline_501021404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d5fc41fc444eb5670da2dfa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
