    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4e37b6f8504cd596978091a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "逐渐逼近的年底决战。\n赢下“菊花赏”的超级溪流也宣布\n自己将会是玉藻十字新的劲敌。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a07419010395f694330f104223c079f47b7bea1a9a2bac588ab3839f338b4f8b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
