    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a15ef1aba7dd5562b0157811",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在决战的高压下，\n玉藻十字的食量又更加减缩，\n这虽也代表她进入备战状态，但……",
      "source_fingerprint": "03656aa033f185065d239013594e44fa553e5cacabaafff5e1b029d62a723535",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
