    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58af07296b275921a5602bfd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "担心继续吃这么少会赢不了小栗帽。\n于是开始思考用别的方法精进自己，\n而一番摸索的结果──",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1bba9b99f5ae0c203f4fb2e58b3dedb49bc014e7e4fef80ecbc49a9be290052",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
