    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eed35f91e1cce031aa60d6bf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "前往夏季集训宿舍的巴士中。\n看着车窗外高速行驶的车阵，\n玉藻十字联想到跌倒意外而感到害怕。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c6a8d193481942883dc33a1497833986aaab8adeecc66591d1f6c738e057f9e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
