      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员温柔地告诉她──\n“会在夏季集训中解决这个问题”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "179c059ee2ff689c94faaaabef73b6efa2353907045aba466be37d567499fed4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
