    {
      "uid": "zhcn:308ab10444a97058b5321a17",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训。据玉藻十字所说，\n她的弟弟最近似乎为了\n“玉藻vs小栗，谁比较快？”跟邻居小孩争吵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "27456b367b13ecbb5d53211975bb3370ec18a341eeca75b76c1c2bc04c84e4ef",
