      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她无法控制自己不去在意\n在经典级重赏比赛成功取胜的小栗帽……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c32be6a8faaeb548a3f4009073a1ca715f8cbf81969b94382d9c4f0acde90f42",
